B.bXt=new A.h6("User rights","Users may update profile details, request account deletion, block chats, report unsafe activity, and contact support about data access or correction.")
B.bXp=new A.h6("Third parties","The app uses secure cloud services for authentication, database, storage, realtime updates, and server functions. Payment, email, SMS, and map providers may process data when those features are used.")
